      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 15%",
      "body": "After last week's 15% share price gain to ₹2,212, the stock trades at a trailing P/E ratio of 23.4x. Average forward P/E is 28x in the Chemicals industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 209% over the past three years.",
